"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> An gano kayan a"
"ikin TPM. Ana shigar da <i>tpm2-tools</i> kai tsaye..."

#: src/onboarding.py:478
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2."
"0 yana aiki. Za a rufe kalmar sirri ta amintaccen cikin TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:480
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Matsayi:</b> An gano kayan ai"
"kin TPM, amma shigarwa ta atomatik na <i>tpm2-tools</i> ya kasa. Gudu "
"<code>sudo dace shigar tpm2-tools</code>. Faɗuwa zuwa tushen caching n"
"a tushen software."

#: src/onboarding.py:482
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ba a gano kayan"
" aikin TPM ba. Yin amfani da caching na tushen software (AES-256-GCM)."

