msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Maɓalli / KW⟧ Buɗewa ta atomatik"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Kunna tantancewar fuska don buɗe maɓallin shiga ta atomatik ko KWallet"
" lokacin shiga. Wannan yana adana amintaccen kalmar sirrin ku a rufe a"
" cikin TPM idan akwai, ko rufaffen ta da AES-256-GCM ta amfani da maɓa"
"lli na tushen kawai. Face auth saita PAM_AUTHTOK don pam_gnome_keyring"
" ko pam_kwallet5 dangane da tebur ɗin ku."

